{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:df1f30519b3bd4c4","name":"Anarrian Security Sergeant","source":{"id":"source:reference-df1f30519b3bd4c4","title":"Anarrian Security Sergeant","revision":23510,"timestamp":"2024-09-29T14:58:11Z","sha256":"68f70c0f6b05df7c71b48e99175ab2524d210a5797979398d53ef2f87ab57c07","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=23510","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Anarrian%20Security%20Sergeant&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-df1f30519b3bd4c4","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Books: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Rulebook"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unknown Regions Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unknown_Regions_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Affiliations: ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Anarrian Empire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Anarrian_Empire","referenceId":"reference:d4c8c819c0572e99"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The ",{"tag":"a","children":["Anarrian"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Anarrian","referenceId":"reference:f80aa9e1b84ea524"}," security team appears after the heroes find ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dilta"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dilta","referenceId":"reference:c8fcf1f4bbe26d5d"}," and convince him to accompany them to the local security center to clear their names. This encounter includes five ",{"tag":"a","children":["Anarrian Security Officers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Anarrian_Security_Officers"}," and one Anarrian Security Sergeant. All the security officers are on foot and have no ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicles"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicles"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Tactics"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["The security team is patrolling the area as normal, but the recent announcement that the heroes are wanted for kidnapping has the officers and sergeant actively looking for the characters. As a result, the security team members are not caught ",{"tag":"a","children":["Flat-Footed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Flat-Footed"}," at the beginning of the battle. They use their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Move Actions"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Move_Actions"}," to find ",{"tag":"a","children":["Cover"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cover"}," in front of one of the nearby buildings. If possible, they remain behind ",{"tag":"a","children":["Cover"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cover"}," until the heroes surrender or are incapacitated.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["After finding ",{"tag":"a","children":["Cover"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cover"},", the Anarrian Security Sergeant uses the ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Born Leader"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Born_Leader"}]}," Talent to grant his officers a bonus to their attack rolls, and he fires at the heroes over the next 2 rounds. If combat continues after that, he uses the ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Coordinate"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Coordinate"}]}," Talent and orders his troops to concentrate their fire on the hero nearest to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dilta"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dilta","referenceId":"reference:c8fcf1f4bbe26d5d"},". The sergeant thinks the characters are criminals and wants to keep them away from the child at all costs.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Anarrian Security Sergeant Statistics (CL 5)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Normal"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Medium ",{"tag":"a","children":["Anarrian"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Anarrian","referenceId":"reference:f80aa9e1b84ea524"}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Nonheroic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Nonheroic","referenceId":"reference:1bca2ef1d9ebe1c3"}," 4/",{"tag":"a","children":["Noble"],"href":"h